<title>USA: Catalyst president named to board.</title>
<headline>Catalyst president named to board.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalyst International Inc said Monday its president and chief operating officer, Sean McGowan, was elected to the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>McGowan filled the vacancy created by Vaemond Crane, former president and former chairman of the board, whose resignation became effective Monday, the warehouse management software company said.</p>
<p>McGowan became president and chief operating officer in January.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
